==English==

===Etymology===
The total number of counties in the island of Ireland

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}
# {{context|Ireland|British|lang=en}} The whole of the island of [[Ireland]], ignoring the distinction between the [[Republic of Ireland]] and [[Northern Ireland]]. 
===Usage notes===
* The term is usually used as a noun modifier, such as "32 county tour" or "32 country republic".
